abstract: |
  Crown Jewel #1 of the CSOAI sovereign assurance stack — a Model
  Context Protocol (MCP) wrapper around CSOAI's live /api/assess endpoint
  that issues Ed25519-signed compliance passports for AI systems
  against EU AI Act Article 6 risk tiers and Annex IV technical
  documentation.

  HONESTY: This tool issues assurance attestations of declared posture —
  not legal certifications. EU AI Act Art 50 compliance requires
  competent-authority evaluation. The signed receipts are the verifiable
  artifact layer; the legal determination sits with the regulator.
